description: "Technical writing by Shrinath Prabhu on frontend architecture, Chrome Extension development, Vue.js patterns, Vite SEO, and building products from zero to launch."
ogTitle: "Blog - Shrinath Prabhu | Frontend Architecture & Chrome Extensions"
ogDescription: "Technical writing on frontend architecture, Chrome Extension development, Vue.js patterns, and building products from zero to launch."
ogType: website
ogImage: "https://shrinath.me/images/blog-meta.jpg"  
